      "text": "The average person is swallowed by eight spiders each year while sleeping. - Author: Welcome to Night Vale - Posted: 2015-11-09T18:49:00+00:00 - Reactions: 0 - Comment count: 215 - Shares: 2799 - Privacy: Public Comments. - Ari Zerner: \"Average person is swallowed by 8 spiders each year\" factoid actually just statistical error.",
